      "description": "The Dinosaur Bar-B-Que restaurant in Rochester, New York.  It is housed in the former Lehigh Valley Railroad Station buildings.  The en:Genesee River runs through the background of the picture, including over the Court Street Dam.  Interstate 490 runs from the left edge to the middle of the image in the background, with the Frederick Douglass – Susan B. Anthony Memorial Bridge on the left.  Part of the Court Street Bridge can be seen disappearing off the right edge of the image.  The Court–Exchange Building is the brick building in the background on the right.  The grassy area in the bottom left corner hides a tunnel through which the Erie Canal once flowed.",
